"<machine.SoftSPI>` work on any GPIO if you need an extra bus."
msgstr ""
"若你需要额外的总线，\\ :ref:`machine.SoftI2C <machine.SoftI2C>` 和 "
":ref:`machine.SoftSPI <machine.SoftSPI>` 可在任意 GPIO 上工作。"

